      "totalDuration": "6 yrs 7 mos",
      "description": "Spearheaded the development of a SaaS solution from architecture to implementation to post-launch operations. To do this, led a team of 10 other engineers to go from a manual prototype to a fully automated productionized system in less than 5 months. During this time, worked with external teams as we changed business models from an upfront to an on-demand model and built infrastructure required for tracking their usage.\n\nPost launch of the MVP, my focus has been on architecting new features, as well as identifying operational issues and how to keep developer / on-call quality of life high (as well as customer satisfaction) through the continued rapid expansion of the new service. I also am responsible for developing long term plans for the technical side of the service and ensuring that new features move us in a direction to solve larger problems.",
